    cpu: rv64: add fwd bnorm training path via JIT stat kernel
    
    Add a fwd stat kernel (sum/sumsq vector reduction) and drop the
    use_global_stats gate so the rv64 JIT bnorm handles training: compute
    per-channel mean/variance into scratchpad, write them back, then run the
    existing transform kernel.

